BLACKPINK is a four-member girl group under YG Entertainment. The members are:
- Jisoo (Kim Ji-soo) – Lead Vocalist, Visual
- **Jennie** (Kim Jennie) – Main Rapper, Vocalist
- **Rosé** (Park Chae-young) – Main Vocalist, Lead Dancer
- **Lisa** (Lalisa Manobal) – Main Dancer, Lead Rapper, Sub-Vocalist

They debuted on **August 8, 2016**, and have since become one of the most successful K-pop groups globally. Are you a BLINK? 😊
